        st:value "For patients with evidence of prior exposure to HBV or HCV: HBV DNA or HCV RNA at D28/M1, M2, M3, M4, and M6. For all other cases: Test as clinically indicated OR if ALT > 3 × ULN. Patients who are HIV-positive but have a negative viral load at screening must continue to have HIV viral load monitored per institutional guidelines for the duration of the study. Not required for a patients with documented disease progression and/or begins a new systemic anticancer treatment at the prior visit." .

